# --------------------------------------------------- measurement data from runs
# Every [S] press writes exports/touchrate_<stamp>/ with a README.md summary,
# summary.json and raw/*.csv. Those are throwaway session captures.
#
# To keep a measurement, copy its folder into results/ - that directory is
# tracked, and the table in README.md links to what is in it.
exports/

